    <content><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note>
<div>Plants make <b>sugar</b> from <i>light</i> and <u>water</u>.&nbsp;See <a href="https://example.org/leaf">the leaf</a> and <a href="evernote:///view/1/2/3/4/">another note</a>.</div>
<div><span style="font-weight: bold; color: rgb(192, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 18px;">Red and bold</span></div>
<div><br/></div>
<div><en-todo checked="true"/>Read chapter 8</div>
<div><en-todo/>Write the report</div>
<ul><li>First point</li><li>Second <b>point</b></li></ul>
<div><en-media hash="2cd8bde463f5d82aae0f0cec061d6b8f" type="image/png"/></div>
<div>Data: <en-media hash="948f0bf3b78b3a6a9000b60786b201ae" type="application/pdf"/></div>
<blockquote><div>Life finds a way.</div></blockquote>
<div style="-en-codeblock:true; font-family: Monaco;"><div>let x = 1;</div><div>let y = 2;</div></div>
<table><tbody><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Where</th></tr><tr><td>Light</td><td>Thylakoid</td></tr></tbody></table>
<div>Secret: <en-crypt hint="pet">ABCDEF</en-crypt></div>
</en-note>]]></content>
